{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the ultimate haven for anime fans and cosplay lovers ... in Japan!</strong><br><br><br>In <i>Cosplay Shop Simulator</i>, you run your very own cosplay store; a colourful, chaotic, and endlessly creative business where passion meets profit. Stock your shelves with <strong>anime comics, collectible figurines, detailed props, iconic masks, themed hats</strong>, and so much more!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961900/extras/fafc6d84c514684b41a461248d007fb9.poster.avif?t=1766055170\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961900/extras/fafc6d84c514684b41a461248d007fb9.webm?t=1766055170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961900/extras/fafc6d84c514684b41a461248d007fb9.mp4?t=1766055170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f <strong>Build &amp; Customize Your Dream Shop</strong><br>Design your store from the ground up \u2014 choose layouts, decorate with flair, and make your shop the go-to destination for every otaku in town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb8 <strong>Sell &amp; Serve With Style</strong><br>Handle daily sales, restock popular items, and don\u2019t forget to <strong>give correct change</strong> to your loyal (and sometimes impatient) customers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 <strong>Hire Entertaining Mascots</strong><br>Bring your shop to life with adorable <strong>dancing mascots</strong> that keep your guests smiling and spending longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Grow Your Cosplay Empire</strong><br>Expand your store, open storages, and become a household name in the cosplay world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Customer Chaos &amp; Events</strong><br>Manage rush hours, fan conventions, and surprise visits! Can you handle the ultimate cosplay rush?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Your Shop, Your Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a business mastermind or a cosplay enthusiast, <i>Cosplay Shop Simulator</i> lets you live your dream of running the most exciting, creative, and fan-fueled store in the city of Japan. Build it, grow it, and make your mark in the world of cosplay culture!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3961900?t=1766055170","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961900/720b79d22c51fe9af822dbe6a4ad6fa13d6d0f09/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766055170","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961900/de66fe0cee64524de0f03a623c5f48b0abd242bd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766055170","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961900/de66fe0cee64524de0f03a623c5f48b0abd242bd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766055170","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the ultimate haven for anime fans and cosplay lovers ... in Japan!</strong><br><br><br>In <i>Cosplay Shop Simulator</i>, you run your very own cosplay store; a colourful, chaotic, and endlessly creative business where passion meets profit. Stock your shelves with <strong>anime comics, collectible figurines, detailed props, iconic masks, themed hats</strong>, and so much more!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961900/extras/fafc6d84c514684b41a461248d007fb9.poster.avif?t=1766055170\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961900/extras/fafc6d84c514684b41a461248d007fb9.webm?t=1766055170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961900/extras/fafc6d84c514684b41a461248d007fb9.mp4?t=1766055170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f <strong>Build &amp; Customize Your Dream Shop</strong><br>Design your store from the ground up \u2014 choose layouts, decorate with flair, and make your shop the go-to destination for every otaku in town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb8 <strong>Sell &amp; Serve With Style</strong><br>Handle daily sales, restock popular items, and don\u2019t forget to <strong>give correct change</strong> to your loyal (and sometimes impatient) customers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 <strong>Hire Entertaining Mascots</strong><br>Bring your shop to life with adorable <strong>dancing mascots</strong> that keep your guests smiling and spending longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Grow Your Cosplay Empire</strong><br>Expand your store, open storages, and become a household name in the cosplay world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Customer Chaos &amp; Events</strong><br>Manage rush hours, fan conventions, and surprise visits! Can you handle the ultimate cosplay rush?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Your Shop, Your Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a business mastermind or a cosplay enthusiast, <i>Cosplay Shop Simulator</i> lets you live your dream of running the most exciting, creative, and fan-fueled store in the city of Japan. Build it, grow it, and make your mark in the world of cosplay culture!</p>","developers":["Mascot Bro Studio","PixelHixel Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961900/3d8734aedf0bb7348cb2fba1b669f3856ac85526/header.jpg?t=1766055170","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Game created and published by Mascot Bro Studio.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3961900/2034009143/9b6d18b7fe97e32c16c9a019aa58e91435dd618f/1760784429/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761476682","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3961900/2034009143/9b6d18b7fe97e32c16c9a019aa58e91435dd618f/1760784429/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761476682","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3961900/2034009143/9b6d18b7fe97e32c16c9a019aa58e91435dd618f/1760784429/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761476682","id":257219577,"name":"Cosplay Shop Simulator - Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257219577/f366a3efe9bd12edb4668d751138d816b41b915c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761476682"}],"name":"Cosplay Shop Simulator","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows (64-bit) 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  i5 3550 / RYZEN 5 2500X<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 / AMD R9 270X</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>